{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261028/photo/bkn-20261028151434574-1028_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261028151434\"/><p>今午(28日)1時28分，有市民致電報案，指其姓劉(52歲)男親人在牛池灣彩盛里的住所內暈倒。救援人員抵達現場時，證實事主已經死亡，其死因有待驗屍後確定。案件列作「屍體發現」跟進。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T07:21:55.630224+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T07:14:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T15:18:30.986404+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T07:18:34.520262+00:00","content_hash":"8c252f5f375fedd52636cdc10ef9d026b2df53709944762ec7beab9e5fcc8ede","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}